  "title": "Tofu Quiche with Broccoli",
  "description": "This vegan tofu quiche is made with broccoli baked with a creamy mixture of pureed tofu and soy milk with a hint of Dijon mustard and garlic.",
  "authors": [
    "WhirledPeas"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-10-09T19:31:09-04:00",
